Tue Oct 20 07:43:39 UTC 2026 - Fridrich Strba <fstrba@suse.com>

- Upgrade to 4.0.0-beta-6
  * Bug Fixes
    + fix: do not clamp negative epoch timestamps to DATE_MIN
    + Remove duplicate LOGGER field in MavenArchiver
    + MJAR-595: Clamp outputTimestamp to DATE_MIN when
      SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH=0
    + fix: report invalid archiver properties
    + Sanitize invalid Automatic-Module-Name instead of failing
    + fix: support negative epoch timestamps in
      parseBuildOutputTimestamp
    + Handle null plugin maps in BuildHelper
    + fix: throw NullPointerException when getManifest is called
      without Session and classpath is enabled
    + fix: prevent NPE in ManifestConfiguration.getClasspathPrefix()
      when prefix is null
    + MSHARED-815: Sanitize newlines in manifest entry values
    + fix: restrict isNumeric() to ASCII digits to prevent
      NumberFormatExceptionRefactor digit validation logic in
      MavenArchiver
  * Documentation updates
    + docs: document null-value behaviour in manifest entry methods
    + Convert the reference page from xdoc to Markdown
    + Fix Javadoc issues per Oracle conventions
  * Maintenance
    + fix: replace deprecated testing stubs with non-deprecated
      equivalents
    + Add tests verifying empty lines in manifest values are
      sanitized
    + Let Dependabot bump the Maven 4 API artifacts
    + MSHARED-815: Pattern.compile() called on every invocation of
      handleSpecificationEntries
    + small optimization
    + Build against Maven 4.0.0-rc-6
    + Fix #371: Cache model.getBuild() result to avoid repeated
      calls
    + Skip unused dependency resolution for addExtensions
    + Mockito improvements
    + JUnit Jupiter best practices
  * Build
    + Add ATR configuration to .asf.yaml
    + Build with the shared workflow's Maven 4 version instead of
      rc-6
    + Keep Dependabot off Mockito 5 on maven-archiver-3.x
  * Dependency updates
    + Bump org.slf4j:slf4j-api from 2.0.17 to 2.0.20
    + Bump org.apache.maven.shared:maven-shared-components from 45
      to 50
    + Bump mavenVersion from 4.0.0-rc-6 to 4.0.0-rc-7
    + Bump org.codehaus.plexus:plexus-interpolation from 1.28 to
      1.30.0
    + Bump org.codehaus.plexus:plexus-archiver from 4.10.2 to 4.14.0
    + Bump apache/maven-gh-actions-shared/.github/workflows/
      /release-drafter.yml from 4 to 5
    + Bump apache/maven-gh-actions-shared/.github/workflows/
      /pr-automation.yml from 4 to 5
    + Bump apache/maven-gh-actions-shared/.github/workflows/
      /maven-verify.yml from 4 to 5
    + Bump apache/maven-gh-actions-shared/.github/workflows/
      /stale.yml from 4 to 5
    + Bump SLF4J API dependency to version 2.0.17
    + Bump Maven version to 4.0.0-rc-5
    + Bump org.codehaus.plexus:plexus-utils from 3.6.0 to 4.0.3
    + Update to parent 48
    + Bump org.assertj:assertj-core from 3.27.6 to 3.27.7

